      "message": "TTD Form Helper — Settings"
   },
   "opt_safety_action_body": {
      "message": "Nothing is filled automatically. The extension types your saved details into the page only when you press a Fill button, and it never submits a booking, never touches payment, and never fills or bypasses CAPTCHA or OTP fields."
   },
   "opt_safety_action_title": {
      "message": "It only acts when you click"
   },
   "opt_safety_code_body": {
      "message": "Zero third-party libraries, no analytics SDK, no code loaded from a CDN, and no eval() or remote scripts — all blocked by script-src 'self'. Everything that runs is in the extension folder and can be read in a text editor. That also removes the supply-chain risk of a compromised npm package."
   },
   "opt_safety_code_title": {
      "message": "It runs no outside code"
   },
   "opt_safety_intro": {
      "message": "Most browser extensions are risky because of what they are *allowed* to do, not because of what they currently do — a harmless extension can be sold or hijacked and silently pushed a malicious update that abuses permissions you already granted. TTD Form Helper is built so that there is nothing useful to hijack:"
   },
   "opt_safety_network_body": {
      "message": "The extension makes no network requests. Its pages run under a Content-Security-Policy of connect-src 'self', which means the browser itself blocks any attempt to contact an outside server — even if the code tried. There is no server, no API, no analytics and no telemetry to send anything to."
   },
   "opt_safety_network_title": {
      "message": "It cannot send data anywhere"
   },
   "opt_safety_permissions_body": {
      "message": "Only \"storage\". It does not request tabs, cookies, webRequest, scripting, downloads, history or clipboard — the permissions that data-stealing extensions rely on. It cannot read your cookies or sessions, and cannot see what other tabs you have open."
   },
   "opt_safety_permissions_title": {
      "message": "It asks for almost no permissions"
   },
   "opt_safety_sites_body": {
      "message": "Site access is restricted to tirupatibalaji.ap.gov.in and ttdevasthanams.ap.gov.in. On every other site — your bank, email, work apps — the extension is not loaded at all and cannot read a single character. You can confirm this on your browser's extension details page under \"Site access\"."
   },
   "opt_safety_sites_title": {
      "message": "It can only touch two websites"
   },
   "opt_safety_title": {
      "message": "Why this extension is safe to use"
   },
   "opt_safety_verify_body": {
      "message": "Open your browser's extension details page to see the permissions and site access listed above. Open DevTools → Network while using the extension and you will see no outbound requests. The full source is unminified and readable."
   },
   "opt_safety_verify_title": {
      "message": "You can verify all of this yourself"
   },
